        "orderIndependence": "Swapping u and v negates their difference but leaves its square and their product unchanged."
      },
      "authorDisplayAnswerPointer": "/answers/2/displayAnswer",
      "authorEvidence": [
        "已知 $u+v=\\sqrt{10}$、$u-v=\\sqrt{6}$。",
        "$4uv=(u+v)^2-(u-v)^2=10-6=4$。",
        "所以 $uv=1$，即这两个数的积等于 1。即使交换两个数，乘积仍不变。"
      ]
